      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is one of the most frustrating things about the new feature. I'd rather appear as the grey robot instead of one of the public avatars, personally. I've made a handful of my avatars Quest compatible and I would love for quest users to see me in my own avatars. It looks like there was an intent to use custom avatars, but the menu keeps disappearing rather quickly.",
