      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In order to use your own Quest avatar for the Fallback system, you must reupload it using the latest SDK and click the checkbox in the build screen that says \"use as fallback\".\nThe avatar must be ranked as Good or better.\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/avatar-fallback-system#can-i-upload-my-own-fallback-avatars-for-my-own-usage",
